# Byte-exact clones on every platform: no line-ending conversion anywhere,
# regardless of a machine's core.autocrlf/core.eol settings. Git for Windows
# defaults autocrlf=true, which would rewrite the repository's LF text files
# to CRLF in the working tree and shift every byte-frozen digest (release
# identity, corpus, kit equality). `-text` disables conversion for all paths.
* -text
